/// VER-1 for `sample.Strict.nothing` (IPC-R5): validating never
/// panics, overflows or reads out of bounds. Bounds: messages of 2 to
/// 2 bytes (its encodings are 2 to 2); loops unwound 2 times.
#[cfg(kani)]
#[kani::proof]
#[kani::unwind(2)]
